      "writtenOn": "2021-02-04T04:28:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@Greg / @Todd, Considering Display and touch driver needs to have communication with standard interface. Both are QC drivers. What is other approach if you want to reject this patch ?\n\n@Todd already suggested to avoid making customization in drm_panel.h/c file. I agree with such hesitation but we need alternative solution/guidance from Google team. We have pending features to support on GKI 2.0.\n\nAs I mentioned earlier, there is no support in upstream DRM framework for such event notification.",
      "parentUuid": "d09fb804_55bcfcec",
      "revId": "1ec5ecf3f50465a06c19412ba084037d565aa4e0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
